    "title": "Girlstart",
    "description": "Working as their digital team, Monkey Puzzle provides ongoing support for the Girlstart website with custom coding and WordPress plugins as well as managing a Google Ad Grants campaign. This includes modifying The Events Calendar Month View using custom templates, creating a fun, interactive calendar; building microsites for other locations; creating an annual report page; and modifying several pages, including program pages. With Google Ad Grants, doubled the number of sessions.\n\nTechnology stack used:\n– WordPress\n– The Events Calendar Pro\n– The Events Calendar\n– HTML\n– CSS\n– PHP\n– Google Analytics / Google Tag Manager\n– Google Ad Grants",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Oct 2017 - Present"
   },
